# subordinators.voc — Conjunctions that open a subordinate clause (quando, porque,
# que). The clause after them is not the homograph's own clause, so its verbs and
# clitics say nothing about it: 'molho sempre que me lembro' is the verb, and
# 'molho picante que arde é bom' is still decided by 'picante'.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

caso
conforme
embora
enquanto
porque
quando
que
